    "Condition : 1 - The proposed extension to the side roof slope to form a gable and the rear dormer extension by means of their, bulk and mass, design, position, disproportionate size, and the rear dormer having limited set ins, would dominate the roof, and by their appearance would harm the character and appearance of the dwelling and the street scene.  It is therefore considered that the proposals are contrary to policies ENV-B.1.1 (All New Development) and H.6.4 (Housing Extensions) of the London Borough of Hounslow UDP, adopted December 2003, and the Council's Residential Extensions Guidelines."
